            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi un metodo chiamato <code>call</code> alla classe.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Contact\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" first = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jane&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" last = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Doe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" cell = \" /><text value=\"&quot;3112445656&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" email = \" /><text value=\"&quot;jdoe@gmail.com&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"func\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getCell\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(cell)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"func\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"call\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;calling...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"156\" endIndex=\"160\" /><option startIndex=\"161\" endIndex=\"165\" /><option startIndex=\"168\" endIndex=\"169\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"self.call\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>func</code>, seguito da <code>call</code> e infine <code>{</code>.</p></body></html>"
